🍔 Swiggy Data Analysis with SQL

This project dives deep into Swiggy's food delivery data using powerful SQL queries to uncover key business insights. From analyzing customer behavior to tracking order trends and delivery efficiency, this analysis provides a comprehensive look at how data drives decisions in the online food delivery space.

📊 Key Highlights:

Customer order trends and peak ordering times

Popular cuisines and top-performing restaurants

Delivery time analysis and service efficiency

Revenue insights and order value segmentation

Geo-based patterns in food delivery


